The Meti-Tarski family of the SMT-LIB benchmark library
=======================================================

The 7006 QF_NRA problems in this directory are the `meti-tarski` family of
the SMT-LIB 2025 release of the non-incremental benchmarks:

    SMT-LIB release 2025 (non-incremental benchmarks)
    Mathias Preiner, Hans-Jorg Schurr, Clark Barrett, Pascal Fontaine,
    Aina Niemetz and Cesare Tinelli
    Zenodo, doi:10.5281/zenodo.16740866
    https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16740866

They are distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/, and are kept here verbatim,
in the directory of the family each belongs to, exactly as the release
holds them.

The problems themselves come from MetiTarski (L. C. Paulson and others),
which produces them as proof obligations on polynomial bounds of the
special functions.
